cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "REMARK Starter Example"
abstract: >-
  A small, complete REMARK (Replications/Reproductions and Explorations Made using ARK) to
  copy when starting a new one. It solves a consumption-saving model with preference shocks
  and a higher interest rate on borrowing than on saving, using Econ-ARK's HARK toolkit,
  and draws its consumption functions; it also shows how code kept in a module, a LaTeX
  document and an interactive dashboard fit into a REMARK. Every package version is pinned
  in uv.lock, and reproduce.sh regenerates every result. It meets Tier 2 (Reproducible
  REMARK) of the REMARK Standard.
